{
"file": 59,
"paths": [
"d007/d000/f209"
],
"lines": [
{
"n": 0,
"h": "a39b6ca8",
"en_raw": "You seem to be resented as always"
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "fffee418",
"en_raw": "that Takayuki Nishi..."
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "dc181801",
"en_raw": "Murase, you"
},
{
"n": 3,
"h": "a9be5ef0",
"en_raw": "were talking with Nishi again"
},
{
"n": 4,
"h": "3d01221d",
"en_raw": "...What are you talking about?"
},
{
"n": 5,
"h": "c192c58b",
"en_raw": "Well, why not"
},
{
"n": 6,
"h": "f5992dcd",
"en_raw": "ask him yourself?"
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "458eb120",
"en_raw": "I saw you behind the school building earlier"
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "cf594356",
"en_raw": "Hey, Kume"
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "87fff5fc",
"en_raw": "About what we were talking about..."
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "0c9d51bf",
"en_raw": "you seemed down"
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "ea12a124",
"en_raw": "so..."
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "e8b8a4be",
"en_raw": "Yeah, well, never mind that"
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "653e262f",
"en_raw": "By the way, the camphor tree"
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "be9070bb",
"en_raw": "standing by the reservoir"
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "dc3b553e",
"en_raw": "that tree, its branches"
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "5aa24797",
"en_raw": "hang down toward the water like"
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "8a9ea19b",
"en_raw": "twisted arms, don't they?"
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "9b61b945",
"en_raw": "...The story of the student who died there"
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "e8935659",
"en_raw": "do you know it?"
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "8c55b675",
"en_raw": "First I've heard of it"
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "efc86c29",
"en_raw": "Listen, Murase"
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "a684e3ca",
"en_raw": "Taking your own life"
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "bd56b44c",
"en_raw": "is the most foolish act"
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "670309f6",
"en_raw": "His grudge"
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "caa09f36",
"en_raw": "still dwells in that camphor tree"
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "42279b21",
"en_raw": "...Kume, what are you talking about?"
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "96d31899",
"en_raw": "There's a really good way"
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "61b8f7d9",
"en_raw": "to vent the stress of"
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "c99862b2",
"en_raw": "your relationships"
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "f8eeae34",
"en_raw": "...That's what I'm saying"
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "36933c45",
"en_raw": "...My stress?"
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "6099db40",
"en_raw": "But naturally"
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "daa0e31d",
"en_raw": "it requires a price"
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "8e1333cb",
"en_raw": "The amount of happiness in the world is limited"
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "f1b6eff4",
"en_raw": "The price is another person's misfortune"
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "494db0cf",
"en_raw": "Huh..."
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "d3da8f5c",
"en_raw": "At the fork in that camphor tree's branches"
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "0099f0a0",
"en_raw": "there's a hidden hollow"
},
{
"n": 39,
"h": "6a6dfdb1",
"en_raw": "...Yes, a hole you could call the mouth"
},
{
"n": 40,
"h": "146b396e",
"en_raw": "of a tree that swallows malice and takes root"
},
{
"n": 41,
"h": "36df41af",
"en_raw": "Throw in a paper with your wish"
},
{
"n": 42,
"h": "4b6347c8",
"en_raw": "and the sacrifice's misfortune"
},
{
"n": 43,
"h": "b988ba4f",
"en_raw": "written on it"
},
{
"n": 44,
"h": "22a90f44",
"en_raw": "Your wish will surely come true"
},
{
"n": 45,
"h": "76da195e",
"en_raw": "That's amazing..."
},
{
"n": 46,
"h": "2e7d6515",
"en_raw": "By the way, Murase"
},
{
"n": 47,
"h": "0711ad73",
"en_raw": "club practice seems to be over for you"
},
{
"n": 48,
"h": "016b5269",
"en_raw": "want to go to the reservoir"
},
{
"n": 49,
"h": "bf56dc32",
"en_raw": "together now?"
},
{
"n": 50,
"h": "915cb95e",
"en_raw": "Heh, you'll meet an interesting guy"
},
{
"n": 51,
"h": "0a193480",
"en_raw": "Today's a bit..."
},
{
"n": 52,
"h": "5caf45e4",
"en_raw": "I'll definitely go next time"
},
{
"n": 53,
"h": "1f0458c4",
"en_raw": "Rumor of the Wish-Granting Camphor Tree"
},
{
"n": 54,
"h": "18599688",
"en_raw": "obtained!"
},
{
"n": 55,
"h": "8f0ef26e",
"en_raw": "Yeah..."
},
{
"n": 56,
"h": "0022eeb7",
"en_raw": "There are things in this world"
},
{
"n": 57,
"h": "f8c45754",
"en_raw": "better left unknown"
},
{
"n": 58,
"h": "b3c18652",
"en_raw": "In a way, you"
},
{
"n": 59,
"h": "bdae02b9",
"en_raw": "might be lucky"
},
{
"n": 60,
"h": "0348378e",
"en_raw": "Aren't you interested in a story like this?"
},
{
"n": 61,
"h": "ea60a027",
"en_raw": "...No, that can't be"
},
{
"n": 62,
"h": "b5596c9d",
"en_raw": "Murase"
},
{
"n": 63,
"h": "043babe8",
"en_raw": "You should remove a few"
},
{
"n": 64,
"h": "e152f49a",
"en_raw": "of the shackles on your heart"
},
{
"n": 65,
"h": "ba4d7fcd",
"en_raw": "I think"
},
{
"n": 66,
"h": "ba519e0b",
"en_raw": "Common sense is trivial"
},
{
"n": 67,
"h": "e41bbc6d",
"en_raw": "nothing worth considering"
},
{
"n": 68,
"h": "8f0ba548",
"en_raw": "Sorry"
},
{
"n": 69,
"h": "757d68d2",
"en_raw": "I have to..."
},
{
"n": 70,
"h": "21174182",
"en_raw": "During summer break, this door"
},
{
"n": 71,
"h": "b0a51fa5",
"en_raw": "should have been opened..."
},
{
"n": 72,
"h": "e51e776c",
"en_raw": "Is he really there...?"
}
]
}